      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おお。……もうすぐ北斗の誕生日だろ、\n少しフンパツしようと思ってな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へー！　じゃあこれも作ってよ、これも、これも！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おまえの誕生日じゃないんだぞ……。\nまあ、別にいいけどよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "001tom",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちゃんと北斗君が喜びそうなもの\n選んであげるから大丈夫だって～。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そういえば、肝心の北斗君の予定は聞いてるの？\n北斗君の誕生日って2月14日じゃん。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "002sht",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_003_02_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_003_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "や……やべぇ！\nLINKしようと思ってたのに忘れてた！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
